"entity": {
"name": "Industrie De Nora SpA",
"description": "Industrie De Nora SpA engages in the provision of electrochemical products and services. It operates through the following segments: Electrode Technologies, Water Technologies, and Energy Transition. The Electrode Technologie segment focuses on offering of metal anodes and cathodes coated with special catalysts, electrolyzer components, and systems, with multiple applications. The segment involves the water treatment systems, electrodes, equipment, systems, and facilities for disinfection and filtration of drinking, wastewater, and processing water. The Energy Transition segment includes the offering of anodes and cathodes, electrolyzer components, and systems. The company was founded by Oronzio De Nora in 1923 and is headquartered in Milan, Italy.",
"rbics_econ": "Non-Energy Materials",
